  "definitionOfMigrated": [
    "Within reusable services, expected domain, dependency, validation, and policy failures use discriminated unions instead of thrown control flow.",
    "Top-level CLI adapters may use bounded typed exceptions to short-circuit command orchestration when translated once into stable output and exit codes.",
    "Other throws are limited to defects, violated invariants, and required host-platform signals.",
    "Unknown failures are narrowed at host and third-party boundaries.",
    "HTTP, MCP, CLI, workflow, and Durable Object adapters translate failures once at their boundary.",
    "Failure and state unions are handled exhaustively.",
    "Tests cover success, representative expected failure families, and boundary translation."
